            "block_content": "• Quality Assurance will begin monitoring 3 calls/contacts each week and the Leader will review the calls/contacts within five (5) business days during the weekly scheduled coaching sessions. The goal of Accelerated Monitoring and the weekly coaching sessions are to improve the CSR IIs' performance without the need to administer a PPP.",
